::  name       consent grant field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a ConsentGrantFact carries exactly nine fields (schema - grant_id -
::             receipt_id - holder_id - recipient_id - scope - granted_at -
::             signer_id - signature)
::  example    9
::  readers    Mantra - Glow Tend - Sur museum - Patchouli weave
::  nib        equinox-e207-mantra-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e207 - Mantra M5 -- fifth Mantra structure pedestal in src/shape/.
::  Names ConsentGrantFact's field count from mantra/src/consent_replay.rye,
::  the second growth milestone's bound-use fact: one purpose, one holder, one
::  recipient, one scope, signed. Pedestal only; Rye still owns refusal_grant,
::  grant_eql, and the replay Log.
::
::  Nine sits under rune_shape.max_fields (15); this pedestal does not raise
::  it, and a tenth field here would still refuse at the rune's own ceiling.
+$  consent-grant-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
  ==
